.jpg"}], "slug": "valkyrie-tune-synthesis-of-souls", "storyline": "An intertwining, resonant serenade of love, sorrow, and fateful encounters calls forth a reboot for the future.\n\nStep into the shoes of Rei, who wakes up in the Domed City of Initium surrounded by women calling him the Messiah. Determined to regain the memories he lost during years of cryosleep, he begins living with the six beautiful members of the TUNED (Tactical Unit for Neutralization and Enhanced Defense)\u2014young women who wield so-called harmonic weapons.\n\nThough lonely and confused in a world governed by enigmatic rules, Rei gradually finds comfort in his new companions.\nEven so, he knows that something is amiss...\nAnd it will only be a matter of time before the secrets of the world come to light.", "summary": "A visual novel that brings the \"Valkyrie Tune\" plastic model series by Good Smile Company to life.\nExperience the resonant story of an amnesiac protagonist and six stunning heroines, whose intertwining serenade of love, sorrow, and fateful encounters calls forth a reboot for the future.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/valkyrie-tune-synthesis-of-souls", "videos": [{"id": 179349, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "5ydJIs3_GDY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5ydJIs3_GDY", "title": "\u3010\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\uff30\uff36\u3011\u30d3\u30b8\u30e5\u30a2\u30eb\u30ce\u30d9\u30eb\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u30fb\u30f4\u30a1\u30eb\u30ad\u30ea\u30fc\u30c1\u30e5\u30fc\u30f3\uff1a\u6a5f\u68b0\u4ed5\u639b\u3051\u306e\u30a2\u30a4\u3010\u7121\u6599\u4f53\u9a13\u7248\u597d\u8a55\u914d\u4fe1\u4e2d\uff01\u3011", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/5ydJIs3_GDY/uhddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 186904, "name": "Game Intro", "video_id": "6gUtqT9JWfY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6gUtqT9JWfY", "title": "\u3010OP\u3011\u30d3\u30b8\u30e5\u30a2\u30eb\u30ce\u30d9\u30eb\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u300e\u30f4\u30a1\u30eb\u30ad\u30ea\u30fc\u30c1\u30e5\u30fc\u30f3\uff1a\u